  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> and its first derivative with respect to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mi></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;when&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> are integers, then the minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> is _______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "481",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mtext>&#160;at&#160;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left right\"><mtr><mtd><mtext>&#160;If&#160;</mtext></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>.</p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>625</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>144</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>481</mn></math></p>"
  }
